n't but for beck it beats  the alternative of continuing full-time  distance education if this is what we  have to work with then we'll work with  it  so the district gave students a choice  of returning to campuses or not  and split them among three cohorts here  you go this is what it's on this uh your  screen  cohort a goes to class in person on  monday and tuesday and attends their  courses remotely online wednesday  through friday  cohort b has class online monday through  wednesday  and goes to campus thursday and friday  cohort c is  full-time distance education now on  april 6th  the rest of the grade levels will go  back in buildings elementary schools  will then transition from hybrid  learning  to classes in person five days a week  reporting live in the newsroom kristen  drummond 8 news now
 

